  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「カホクザンショウ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AB%E3%83%9B%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B6%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%82%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 107513233,
      "text": "カホクザンショウ は、中国のミカン科サンショウ属の落葉低木である。日本原産のサンショウ（山椒）とは同属異種に当たる。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Zanthoxylum bungeanum」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zanthoxylum_bungeanum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1356353558,
      "text": "Zanthoxylum bungeanum  is a species of plant in the family Rutaceae. It is one of the sources of the spice Sichuan pepper. The plant is native to North-Central China, South-Central China, Southeast China, East Himalayas, Inner Mongolia, Manchuria, Nepal, Qinghai, Tibet, Xinjiang. It has also been introduced into Uzbekistan. Studies have shown that essential oils from Z. bungeanum Maxim can be used as a natural pest control agent against the Drugstore beetle pest. Its seed, called Sichuanese Peppercorn, has been served as a traditional medicine and used as cooking spice in China."
    }
  },
